     <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">07 / PROJECT REQUEST</p>
      <h2 data-template-id="contact-heading" class="canva-text mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em] md:text-5xl" style="color: rgb(245, 247, 250); font-weight: 700;">LET'S BUILD THE NEXT MOVE.</h2>
      <p data-template-id="contact-copy" class="canva-text mt-6 leading-8" style="color: rgb(156, 166, 181);">Share what you are building, where you want to grow, and the kind of support you need. Your request is saved privately for review.</p>
      <div class="mt-9 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/5 p-6">
       <h3 data-template-id="contact-side-title" class="canva-text font-bold" style="color: rgb(245, 247, 250); font-weight: 700;">A MORE FOCUSED START</h3>
       <p data-template-id="contact-side-copy" class="canva-text mt-2 text-sm leading-7" style="color: rgb(156, 166, 181);">A clear project brief creates a better starting point for the right strategy.</p>
      </div>
