      <h2 data-template-id="faq-heading" class="canva-text mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-.05em] md:text-5xl" style="color: rgb(245, 247, 250); font-weight: 700;">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS.</h2>
     </div>
     <div class="mt-10 space-y-2">
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4"><button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do you work with small businesses?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">Yes. Strategy can be adapted around your business goals, audience, offer, and available resources.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4"><button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do you guarantee leads or sales?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">No. Performance depends on market demand, audience, offer, competition, creative, landing pages, and budget.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4">
       <button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can you manage Google Ads campaigns?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
