        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4">
       <button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can you manage Meta Ads?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">Support can cover Facebook and Instagram audience research, campaign direction, creative testing, and retargeting.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4">
       <button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What advertising budget do I need?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">Budgets depend on your goals, audience, market, and channels. A project conversation can help identify a practical starting point.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4">
       <button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">How is campaign reporting handled?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">Reporting can focus on agreed goals and available campaign signals. Any dashboard figures shown here are demonstration data only.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq border-b border-white/10 py-4">
       <button class="faq-button flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left font-semibold" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can we work together remotely?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="faq-chevron"></i></button>
       <div class="faq-answer">
        <div>
         <p class="pt-4 leading-7 text-[#9CA6B5]">Yes. Project requirements and strategy can be discussed remotely through the project request form.</p>
        </div>
       </div>
      </article>
     </div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section id="admin-content-model" class="hidden" aria-label="Non-public content model">
    <h2>GrowthHub content model</h2>
    <p>Editable non-public collections: Services, Insights, FAQs, Case Studies, About, Pricing, Testimonials, and Contact Requests. Testimonials remain unpublished until verified. Case studies replace demo data only with verified campaign information. Pipeline: New → Contacted → Requirement Confirmed → Proposal Sent → Follow-up → Won → Lost.</p>
   </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#070A0F] pb-24 pt-14">
   <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
     <div>
      <h2 data-template-id="footer-logo" class="canva-text font-bold tracking-[.13em]" style="color: rgb(245, 247, 250); font-weight: 700;">GROWTHHUB</h2>
      <p data-template-id="footer-descriptor" class="canva-text mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-7" style="color: rgb(156, 166, 181);">Digital Marketing • Paid Ads • Social Growth</p>
      <p data-template-id="footer-tagline" class="canva-text mt-5 text-xs font-bold tracking-[.12em]" style="color: rgb(0, 212, 255); font-weight: 700;">TURN ATTENTION INTO GROWTH.</p>
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#00D4FF]">NAVIGATE</h3>
      <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-[#9CA6B5]"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#insights">Insights</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#00D4FF]">CONNECT</h3>
      <p data-template-id="footer-connect-copy" class="canva-text mt-4 text-sm leading-7" style="color: rgb(156, 166, 181);">Social and direct-contact routes can be configured when real contact details are ready. Until then, use the project request form.</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex gap-3"><a class="js-social rounded-full border border-white/15 p-3" href="#contact" aria-label="Instagram"><i data-lucide="instagram"></i></a><a class="js-social rounded-full border border-white/15 p-3" href="#contact" aria-label="Facebook"><i data-lucide="facebook"></i></a><a class="js-social rounded-full border border-white/15 p-3" href="#contact" aria-label="LinkedIn"><i data-lucide="linkedin"></i></a><a class="js-whatsapp rounded-full border border-white/15 p-3" href="#contact" aria-label="WhatsApp"><i data-lucide="message-circle"></i></a>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-[#9CA6B5]"><span data-template-id="footer-copyright" class="canva-text" style="color: rgb(156, 166, 181);">© 2026 GrowthHub. All rights reserved.</span><span>Privacy Policy · Terms &amp; Conditions · Cookie Policy</span>
    </div>
   </div>
  </footer>
  <div class="mobile-bar fixed bottom-0 z-40 w-full grid-cols-3 border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0D1117]/95 p-2 backdrop-blur"><a class="js-whatsapp rounded-lg py-3 text-center text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-[#00D4FF]" href="#contact">WHATSAPP</a><a class="js-call rounded-lg py-3 text-center text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-[#00D4FF]" href="#contact">CALL</a><a class="rounded-lg bg-[#6C63FF] py-3 text-center text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider" href="#contact">START PROJECT</a>
  </div>
  <script>
    const contactConfig={whatsappUrl:"",phone:"",email:"",instagramUrl:"",linkedinUrl:"",googleAnalytics:"",googleTagManager:"",searchConsole:"",metaPixel:""};
    const analyticsEvent=name=>window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("growthhub:analytics",{detail:{name,consentAware:true}}));
    const clean=value=>String(value||"").replace(/[<>]/g,"").trim().slice(0,2000);

    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",()=>{
      lucide.createIcons();
      const menuButton=document.getElementById("menuButton"),mobileMenu=document.getElementById("mobileMenu");
      menuButton.addEventListener("click",()=>{const hidden=mobileMenu.classList.toggle("hidden");menuButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(!hidden));});
      mobileMenu.querySelectorAll("a").forEach(link=>link.addEventListener("click",()=>{mobileMenu.classList.add("hidden");menuButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");}));
      document.querySelectorAll(".service-toggle").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>{const card=button.closest(".service"),open=card.classList.toggle("open");button.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(open));analyticsEvent("service_engagement");}));
      document.querySelectorAll(".faq-button").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>{const item=button.closest(".faq"),open=item.classList.toggle("open");button.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(open));}));
      document.querySelectorAll(".filter").forEach(button=>button.addEventListener("click",()=>{const filter=button.dataset.filter;document.querySelectorAll(".filter").forEach(item=>item.classList.remove("active"));button.classList.add("active");document.querySelectorAll(".insight").forEach(card=>card.hidden=filter!=="all"&&card.dataset.category!==filter);}));
      document.querySelectorAll(".js-whatsapp").forEach(link=>link.addEventListener("click",event=>{analyticsEvent("whatsapp_click");if(!contactConfig.whatsappUrl)return;event.preventDefault();window.open(contactConfig.whatsappUrl,"_blank","noopener,noreferrer");}));
      document.querySelectorAll(".js-call").forEach(link=>link.addEventListener("click",event=>{analyticsEvent("call_click");if(!contactConfig.phone)return;event.preventDefault();window.open("tel:"+contactConfig.phone,"_blank","noopener,noreferrer");}));
      document.querySelectorAll('a[href="#contact"]').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener("click",()=>analyticsEvent("consultation_cta")));
      const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(entry=>{if(entry.isIntersecting)entry.target.classList.add("show");}),{threshold:.12});document.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach(item=>observer.observe(item));
      [25,50,75,100].forEach(mark=>{let fired=false;window.addEventListener("scroll",()=>{if(!fired&&((window.scrollY+window.innerHeight)/document.documentElement.scrollHeight)*100>=mark){fired=true;analyticsEvent("scroll_depth_"+mark);}}, {passive:true});});
    });

    document.getElementById("leadForm").addEventListener("submit",async event=>{
      event.preventDefault();
      const form=event.currentTarget,submit=form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]'),message=document.getElementById("formMessage");
      const fields=[["fullName","fullNameError"],["businessName","businessNameError"],["phone","phoneError"],["email","emailError"],["businessType","businessTypeError"],["serviceRequired","serviceRequiredError"],["budget","budgetError"],["goal","goalError"],["message","messageError"]];
      let valid=true;
      fields.forEach(([id,errorId])=>{const input=document.getElementById(id),error=document.getElementById(errorId);error.textContent=input.value.trim()?"":"This field is required.";if(!input.value.trim())valid=false;});
      const email=document.getElementById("email");
      if(email.value&&!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email.value)){document.getElementById("emailError").textContent="Enter a valid email address.";valid=false;}
      if(!document.getElementById("consent").checked){document.getElementById("consentError").textContent="Consent is required to submit this request.";valid=false;}else document.getElementById("consentError").textContent="";
      if(document.getElementById("companyWebsite").value){message.textContent="Unable to submit this request.";return;}
      if(!valid){message.textContent="Please review the highlighted fields.";return;}
      submit.disabled=true;submit.style.opacity=".65";message.textContent="Sending project details…";
      const record={full_name:clean(form.full_name.value),business_name:clean(form.business_name.value),phone:clean(form.phone.value),email:clean(form.email.value),website_or_instagram:clean(form.website_or_instagram.value),business_type:clean(form.business_type.value),services_needed:clean(form.services_needed.value),budget:clean(form.budget.value),main_goal:clean(form.main_goal.value),message:clean(form.message.value),status:"New",source:"GrowthHub website project request",created_at:new Date().toISOString()};
      try{const result=await window.dataSdk.create(record);if(!result.isOk){message.textContent="We could not confirm your request. Please try again later.";return;}document.getElementById("formFields").classList.add("hidden");document.getElementById("formSuccess").classList.remove("hidden");lucide.createIcons();analyticsEvent("contact_form_submission");}catch(error){message.textContent="We could not send your request. Please try again later.";}finally{submit.disabled=false;submit.style.opacity="1";}
    });
    window.dataSdk.init({onDataChanged(){}}).then(result=>{if(!result.isOk){const message=document.getElementById("formMessage");if(message)message.textContent="The form is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later.";}}).catch(()=>{});
  </script>
 
</body></html>